===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*peh₂-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|companye||a team; companionship}}, from {{der|en|fro|compaignie||companionship}} (Modern French: {{m|fr|compagnie}}), possibly from {{der|en|la-lat||*compania}}, but this word is not attested. {{cog|fro|compaignie}} is equivalent to {{cog|fro|compaignon}} (Modern French: {{m|fr|compagnon}}) + {{m|fro|-ie}}. More at {{m|en|companion}}.

Displaced native {{noncog|ang|werod}}, {{m|ang|gefer}}, {{m|ang|getæl}}, and {{m|ang|hired}}.

